    destruct H as (FI & LOW & DIG & PAD & HS & APC & Hk & AOK & FPC & BODY & BRNG & BLOC & BHI & Hn & (rb & RCb & IRb & RRb) & RGb & HPFX & PRNG & PF0 & PF1 & Hpl & PL2 & PFlo & PFhi & Hi4 & Hfl & HnI & Hnp & Hplp);
